  "label": "Cigarette Smoking as Stereotype",
  "description": "In popular culture, smoking a cigarette is often associated with certain archetypes — such as the 'cool' rebel, the 'tough' man, or the 'disengaged' intellectual. In this meme, the cigarette may be used to reinforce the stereotype of the man as someone who is apathetic or detached, thereby undermining the sincerity of his 'freedom of speech' declaration.",
